SY_TALK("5ZGbnhiGXcg",[[650,["I bow to all the seekers of truth."]],[658,["At the very outset we have to understand that truth is what it is."]],[670,["We cannot conceptualize it."]],[672,["We cannot organize it."]],[676,["And we cannot use it for our own purposes."]],[681,["Moreover, with the blinkers on both the sides like a horse, with all our conditionings,"]],[691,["we cannot find the truth."]],[694,["We have to be free people."]],[696,["We have to be open-minded people, like scientists, to see for ourselves what is the truth."]],[706,["If somebody preaches something, professes something, says something, is not to be accepted"]],[716,["blindfolded."]],[720,["As I told you yesterday, that the essence of all the religions is to find the eternal"]],[727,["and to treat the transitory in its own understanding and in its own limitations."]],[736,["That’s why we have lost our balance."]],[740,["If we are really the people who want to know the truth, we have to know that at human awareness"]],[755,["we cannot know it."]],[758,["It becomes a concept."]],[762,["You have to have the spiritual awareness, but spiritual awareness is a state of your"]],[771,["being, where you become the spirit."]],[776,["Again the word I’ll say – “become.”"]],[778,["It’s not artificially certifying somebody that now you have become a Hindu or a Christian"]],[785,["or a Muslim, you become anything."]],[789,["Because you may be a Muslim, Christian, Hindu, anything, you can commit any sin."]],[796,["You can do anything that is wrong."]],[799,["Nothing from inside is going to stop you."]],[805,["So all these things have become so much outward that now there are people who have started"]],[812,["saying there is no God, there is nothing like religion, which is not true."]],[820,["First of all when we say there is nothing, or there is not God, we should find out, have"]],[828,["we been able to find out about it or just in our ego we are saying there is no God?"]],[837,["Have we been able to work it out to see if there is God or not?"]],[843,["You do not judge God by the people who talk about God."]],[848,["Anybody can talk about God because they think there’s no law that can catch them."]],[854,["They can talk against Him, they can talk for Him, they can do the way they like."]],[859,["They can even make money by talking against God and against all the prophets – that’s"]],[864,["a very good way of making money, blackmail."]],[870,["But does that mean that whatever is written is a bible, or whatever is black and white,"]],[878,["is to be taken that seriously?"]],[883,["So first of all, we have to be little independent to be free, to know that if you have to know"]],[892,["the spirit - as they said “know thyself” - then you have to know it on your central"]],[900,["nervous system."]],[902,["As I can feel this is cold or hot, you have to feel the divine power which is all-pervading,"]],[917,["which is the truth, which manifests the truth, because it is the love of God."]],[927,["You have to first feel it on your central nervous system, which is the bodha."]],[938,["Now one may say that in the West we have advanced so much, all right."]],[946,["We have gone too far with everything."]],[950,["But if we see, when we started with science, what have we produced?"]],[958,["Hydrogen bomb, atom bomb, all kinds of devils sitting on our heads."]],[964,["You take to any enterprise that we did, we go to extremes."]],[972,["There is no balance."]],[975,["Any mental projection is linear, it moves in one line and then recoils back, and then"]],[981,["you are shocked."]],[983,["Now you have got acid rain."]],[984,["You produced machinery, all right."]],[988,["Machinery is for you, you are not for machinery."]],[993,["And thus, there is no balance between you and the machinery, no balance between you"]],[1002,["and the science."]],[1003,["It is just like going amok with anything that you get into your hand."]],[1010,["And this balance you can only have when you become the spirit."]],[1018,["You see beautiful chandeliers here, beautifully made, but unless and until there is light"]],[1025,["what is the meaning of these chandeliers?"]],[1029,["Nothing."]],[1031,["In the same way, if you do not have the light of the spirit shining in your attention, you"]],[1039,["will not know your meaning."]],[1040,["Like this instrument – unless and until it is connected to the mains, it is useless."]],[1046,["Unless and until we are connected to the mains, we do not know the absolute, and that’s"]],[1054,["why all these problems are there."]],[1057,["Now when I am talking about this instrument, which lies within us, one has to again know"]],[1070,["that this is the knowledge of the roots."]],[1076,["And to know the knowledge of the roots, you have to become a subtler personality."]],[1080,["With a gross mind, you cannot see it."]],[1085,["To become the subtler personality, minimum of minimum, you have to know that so far you"]],[1092,["have not known the roots."]],[1095,["If you had known, there would be no problem."]],[1098,["But there’s something has gone wrong somewhere in every human enterprise, even in religions,"]],[1110,["that’s why today we find this kind of a farce going on."]],[1121,["And what is gone wrong is that we have to seek the eternal."]],[1128,["Maybe it might look a little different, for example Buddha and Mahavira did not talk about"]],[1136,["God at all."]],[1138,["I also did not talk about God for four years, at least three years."]],[1147,["As soon as you talk of God, again people start jumping, “When can we become God?” – this"]],[1154,["is the first question."]],[1158,["So first you become the self –the first step."]],[1161,["That’s why they did not talk."]],[1164,["They said first you become yourself."]],[1168,["Unless and until you have your eyes, how can you see the colors?"]],[1176,["So first have your eyes."]],[1178,["It is for your benevolence that you better get what you deserve, what is your own."]],[1191,["It’s your birthright as a human being to become the spirit."]],[1197,["That is what Sahaja Yoga is – Saha means “with” and ja is “born.”"]],[1201,["Born with you is the right to get this yoga, is the union with the Divine."]],[1212,["It’s your birthright as a human being."]],[1216,["You are as I told you at the epitome of evolution."]],[1221,["And it has to work out, but please open your hearts and open your minds."]],[1231,["Just open it and see for yourself, it will work, I know."]],[1235,["Yesterday it has worked."]],[1236,["It is going to work out today also."]],[1239,["But by thinking about it, you cannot conceptualize."]],[1245,["This is the biggest problem of our seeking that we run after some sort of a concept."]],[1256,["Now here you have seen this instrument is the most beautiful instrument that is created"]],[1263,["within us during the process of our evolution."]],[1268,["The first one is the most beautiful one because it stands for our innocence."]],[1276,["This innocence is the one which gives us real support, real strength."]],[1285,["And you’ll be surprised it is never destroyed."]],[1290,["It may be overshadowed, there may be clouds."]],[1297,["Maybe it may look to be a very dark sky."]],[1302,["Maybe a hopeless case."]],[1303,["Some people might say that we have destroyed our innocence."]],[1308,["It cannot be destroyed."]],[1312,["Whatever you might have done, this is one center which cannot be destroyed."]],[1318,["You may have problems with it but it cannot be destroyed."]],[1322,["It is such a wonderful center you have got, which has got four petals, which looks after"]],[1328,["the pelvic plexus, looks after all the excretion within us."]],[1336,["In our own freedom, so-called, we do all kinds of things which may not be benevolent for"]],[1346,["ourselves, doesn’t matter."]],[1350,["Kundalini cannot be destroyed - the source which is going to give you the self-realization,"]],[1365,["I say She is your individual Mother."]],[1368,["And this Mother is such a loving Mother and She knows each and everything about you - from"]],[1375,["your past, from your past lives - She knows you very well."]],[1381,["She is just waiting for a chance that She can be awakened and She can give you your"]],[1389,["second birth."]],[1390,["When you were born, your mother suffered for you – you did not suffer."]],[1396,["So to say that Kundalini awakening gives this kind of a nonsense and that kind of a nonsense"]],[1402,["is all falsehood."]],[1405,["Absolutely falsehood."]],[1407,["And it is so absurd that how can a mother give you problems?"]],[1413,["I mean, I don’t know about some mothers are funny also – that’s all human problems."]],[1420,["But this is a Divine Mother."]],[1423,["She’s not going to give you trouble."]],[1428,["But these problems that have come are coming from people who have no authority, who have"]],[1435,["no education, who do not know what Kundalini is."]],[1439,["Some say it is in the stomach, some say in the head, some say in the legs."]],[1445,["Those who have no character of their own, because they have to be pure people themselves,"]],[1452,["try all kinds of nonsensical tricks and create problems on the sympathetic nervous system"]],[1458,["and they call it as something that it is the problem of the Kundalini."]],[1466,["Kundalini will never give you any problems."]],[1470,["On the contrary, when She rises and when you get your awakening, the first thing that is"]],[1476,["established is thoughtless awareness."]],[1479,["For when a thought rises, falls, another thought rises, falls, and the Kundalini makes the"]],[1491,["thoughts smaller and in between at the present."]],[1496,["It makes you stop in the present and you grow in the present, and the thoughts, if you want"]],[1505,["to think you can think, if you don’t want to think, it is not like a madhouse going"]],[1509,["on all the time, you don’t know how to stop it."]],[1516,["This works out with the Kundalini’s awakening when She crosses this center of ours, which"]],[1524,["we call as Agnya chakra."]],[1526,["Now we should not have, again I say, blinkers about Christ."]],[1529,["Let us see what people have to say about Christ in other shastras and scriptures."]],[1536,["Who was He?"]],[1541,["Because people did not allow Him to manifest for more than four years and in four years"]],[1547,["what can you do?"]],[1548,["You cannot do anything."]],[1552,["I must tell you in London I came, My husband was selected for a job and that’s how we"]],[1558,["are here, and for four years I was struggling with seven of them, just struggling."]],[1565,["Giving realization was such a difficult subject to the English people at that time."]],[1571,["They are hard nuts, I know."]],[1574,["But once they break, they are the best."]],[1578,["I think the best are the hardest."]],[1580,["And it worked, it clicked."]],[1585,["I am surprised that I had to work very hard but they are such a foundation of Sahaja Yoga."]],[1594,["Immediately they went all out and very scholarly also – a lot of scholarship in them."]],[1599,["Found out all about Kundalini, everything from wherever – your libraries are so well-equipped."]],[1606,["And I was surprised, it was all there."]],[1610,["They studied Sanskrit."]],[1613,["Now can you imagine these people English singing Sanskrit song with that speed?"]],[1619,["They could not even say one sentence in Hindi when they were in India."]],[1624,["Three hundred years they were there, they could not speak one sentence you will be surprised."]],[1630,["We had to tell them in English how to speak Hindi."]],[1634,["Like you have to say “open the door” – is in Hindi, is darwaja khol do."]],[1641,["They couldn’t say it."]],[1642,["So we had to say, “there was a banker” or something like that – means “close"]],[1647,["the door” – “there was a banker.”"]],[1648,["They couldn’t speak Hindi."]],[1652,["Sanskrit is very far off."]],[1654,["And now look at them, what has happened to them."]],[1657,["And Indian music is such a difficult music, you have to really, it is a question of penance,"]],[1664,["tremendous penance."]],[1665,["Now we have people who play beautiful tabla, beautiful instruments not only but sing so"]],[1671,["well."]],[1672,["Swiss, the hardest nuts you can ever think of, they are - you’ll be amazed the Swiss"]],[1680,["the way they sing, tremendous manifestation in such a short time."]],[1689,["Of course they can also sing English very well, they know English music very well, or"]],[1695,["should say Western music very well."]],[1697,["But to learn this difficult melodies of India is remarkable."]],[1702,["I am myself surprised at this."]],[1705,["So what happens in the second center when it enters, you just become dynamic, because"]],[1714,["the second center is for aesthetics and for creativity."]],[1718,["Now we have, like My brother who was a chartered accountant, he was very bad at all the languages."]],[1728,["Very bad, of course Sanskrit was out of question."]],[1731,["Now he is making poetry in Sanskrit and in Urdu language and also in Marathi, which is"]],[1738,["the most difficult language."]],[1741,["This is the second center."]],[1742,["When Kundalini nourishes that center, like a very beautiful Mother she nourishes."]],[1749,["You must have heard about some great artists – Amjad Ali, he was here – after realization"]],[1757,["he became such a great artist."]],[1759,["There are so many artists."]],[1761,["In India, they understand."]],[1763,["They want to sing before Me."]],[1765,["I mean I don’t know how to say that now only one person can sing."]],[1769,["Because their Kundalini goes up, and the creativity becomes so tremendously active and so dynamic."]],[1777,["At the same time, that person becomes very mild, very sweet, very compassionate."]],[1786,["Like there’s one great singer."]],[1789,["She’s a Muslim lady, I will not name her."]],[1793,["She wanted to sing and she sent Me word, “Please allow me to sing in Your birthday.”"]],[1797,["And I said, “All right, give her a chance.”"]],[1799,["So she came down."]],[1801,["And the lady who was playing harmonium – she came and told Me, “This lady is just an"]],[1808,["atom bomb, You don’t know how she gets angry if there’s one note I play wrong.”"]],[1815,["I saw her but she was very silently playing – nothing doing, she never got angry with"]],[1821,["anyone."]],[1822,["So in the interval, this lady comes and tells Me, “That see in Your presence, I don’t"]],[1826,["know what has happened to this lady."]],[1829,["This tiger has become like a cow."]],[1833,["How is it?”"]],[1834,["I said, “See her Kundalini has come up.”"]],[1838,["So this violence, this anger, this temper is not your creation, it’s the creation"]],[1847,["of your liver."]],[1848,["Your liver is little out of order because of many things, and the temper is there."]],[1860,["Now when the temper is too much, you don’t know what to do."]],[1863,["I mean you can do whatever you like."]],[1866,["In your temper after all, it’s like a drunken personality."]],[1870,["You have to approach a person in a temper with a barge pole."]],[1875,["But all this temper, everything, becomes so cool and so beautiful."]],[1880,["It’s very surprising."]],[1883,["A very dynamic person becomes extremely compassionate, extremely compassionate, and I’ve had such"]],[1892,["beautiful experiences of their compassion that it’s not easy to describe."]],[1901,["Now also they say that there are certain nationalities which has got a trait like this and a trait"]],[1909,["like that, everything dissolves."]],[1913,["Everything dissolves because of this center which is so creative and which also gives"]],[1922,["you the manifestation of pure knowledge - pure knowledge."]],[1929,["For example you start feeling on your finger tips – you just start feeling on your finger"]],[1936,["tips."]],[1937,["Like today only, somebody came and told Me, “That Mataji my Agnya is catching.”"]],[1944,["Agnya is this center - means “I’ve got my ego on.”"]],[1950,["Will anybody say like that?"]],[1952,["On the contrary if you tell somebody, “You have got your ego,” they’ll show you that"]],[1956,["they have their ego on."]],[1958,["It’s very dangerous to say to somebody that your ego is on."]],[1962,["But just because of self knowledge - pure knowledge - you know that this Mr. Ego is"]],[1968,["sitting here and I cannot cross through and there’s a blockage here, which I have to"]],[1979,["take it out."]],[1980,["It’s so innate within you, everything, only thing is your connection has to be made."]],[1984,["Once the connection is made, immediately you know about yourself."]],[1988,["And this center which is responsible for creating all kinds of funny thoughts and horrible creativity"]],[2000,["becomes so benevolent, so soothing, so beautiful."]],[2006,["Apart from that, as I told you just now, these people who could not even say one word in"]],[2014,["Hindi language have started singing Sanskrit and this - specially the one they sang, the"]],[2021,["first one - many Indians cannot sing that way I can tell you, they can’t."]],[2029,["It’s not easy."]],[2030,["It’s a very great tongue twister first of all the language is."]],[2035,["Apart from that, to sing in such a correct pronunciation is so difficult but they have"]],[2042,["done it."]],[2047,["So in Sahaja Yoga, an artist who is struggling today may become a great artist tomorrow."]],[2054,["But still I would say these are temptations."]],[2058,["You’ll become a great artist, you’ll start earning more money, this, that…but that’s"]],[2063,["not the one."]],[2064,["You have to really be satisfied with, you will never be satisfied with that."]],[2070,["So you move to the third center which we call as the Nabhi chakra."]],[2077,["This center is, on one side, is made of water and another side with fire."]],[2087,["Around it are our ten valencies, which we can call as our innate religion within ourselves."]],[2099,["Now this Nabhi itself, or we can call the solar plexus"]],[2105,["or we can say the Navel chakra"]],[2111,["gives us, as soon as the Kundalini rises,"]],[2117,["she awakens this and the light when it spreads,"]],[2121,["you become religious."]],[2122,["I don’t have to tell you anything, you just become."]],[2127,["I don’t have to say that you don’t take drugs, you just don’t take it."]],[2131,["Overnight I have seen people have given up drugs."]],[2135,["Overnight, alcoholism. Overnight, everything."]],[2138,["And they enjoy their virtues.","That’s the best part of it."]],[2142,["Some people think, well then what is the fun?"]],[2145,["What is this that you take something in the pub and next day you have hangover."]],[2153,["Here you take something and next day you are much better off."]],[2159,["It never comes down. It never gives you a reaction."]],[2163,["It’s not artificial.","It’s not intoxicating."]],[2167,["It is from your nerves it’s bubbling out."]],[2172,["So this is the center which is very important in us"]],[2175,["because most of us have a problem with","this center."]],[2182,["And here we have a capacity by this center"]],[2189,["that we enjoy our generosity."]],[2201,["Now all matter whatever it is -","we are materialistic, materialistic,"]],[2205,["it is a good idea to be materialistic."]],[2208,["But the matter is, the aesthetics of matters are,"]],[2213,["that you can give it to others suggesting","your love in it."]],[2218,["I think that’s the only thing the matter can do."]],[2224,["And in a very special way you can express that love."]],[2229,["For example, somebody likes a particular thing"]],[2233,["you go all the way to get it"]],[2236,["and give that small thing, very small thing,"]],[2241,["to the person and the joy,"]],[2246,["not out of the money that you have spent,"]],[2250,["but the feelings you have expressed","of knowing what that person would love."]],[2259,["And this kind of a depth develops within you."]],[2267,["Such lovable beautiful society you enter into."]],[2275,["And you don’t need anything because everybody is looking after your needs."]],[2280,["Now I have told them I love flowers because I don’t take anything else."]],[2286,["So you must see whenever I come My house is so filled with flowers that My husband was"]],[2290,["saying, “Let us go live in the garden and let the flowers be here.”"]],[2294,["So you see the joy of giving, comes from this center."]],[2304,["And whatever you eat, whatever you have to eat, whatever is good for you, you eat."]],[2315,["You don’t have to bother as to what to eat, what not to eat – you just eat whatever"]],[2320,["is good for you, benevolent for you."]],[2323,["You become so wise and also you please others."]],[2328,["You don’t displease others by saying, “This is bad food, I want that.”"]],[2333,["’I want’ goes away."]],[2335,["What do you want?"]],[2338,["[speaks aside]"]],[2340,["So the, like you could say a candle which is not enlightened, is waiting to be enlightened,"]],[2350,["is asking for the light – “I want light.”"]],[2354,["But once it is enlightened, it gives light to others, automatically - supposed to be."]],[2362,["In the same way you also start giving your light, your love, your joy to others, automatically."]],[2371,["I don’t have to tell you."]],[2373,["Nobody has to go through any Ten Commandments anymore."]],[2377,["Those days are gone."]],[2379,["Now automatically you become like that - very beautiful people, very affectionate and glorious,"]],[2395,["I should say."]],[2396,["If you see the glow on the face of Sahaja Yogis, the face itself is radiant."]],[2403,["Many people drop out their ten years to twenty years in their age and they are so enthusiastic,"]],[2414,["never get tired, especially in England I’ve seen – or also in the West I would say everywhere"]],[2421,["– people get very really tired."]],[2423,["On the television also you find people will come and sit down “huh…”"]],[2427,["Young people, they’ll talk ten times, they’ll say “huh…"]],[2435,["Why are we so tired?”"]],[2439,["Because we think too much."]],[2441,["All energy is wasted in thinking, so no energy left to enjoy anything whatsoever."]],[2448,["For example, you have to have people for dinner, they think what to bring, how to make it formal,"]],[2455,["what to do, this thing, that thing, so agitated and so nervous about the whole thing – when"]],[2461,["the guests come in, they feel like running away."]],[2465,["Because so much of tension of thinking, thinking, thinking….."]],[2469,["Planning, planning, planning, planning, planning…"]],[2473,["Ultimately the whole joy has disappeared."]],[2477,["So the second center which is there, it does a very miraculous thing, is to provide the"]],[2488,["grey cells in our brain, when we are using it for thinking, and also it looks after your"]],[2495,["liver, your pancreas, your spleen, your kidneys and lower part of your abdomen."]],[2506,["Instead of doing that, poor thing is busy only sending grey cells to your brain because"]],[2512,["thinking, thinking, thinking, thinking, like mad."]],[2516,["So you develop all other diseases – liver trouble, which is very common."]],[2522,["Then you develop diabetes – very common."]],[2526,["Yesterday at least there were ten people who said we have diabetes."]],[2534,["Now diabetes you do not develop by taking too much sugar – take it from Me."]],[2539,["In India if you go to a village, you’ll see that he takes sugar in such a manner that"]],[2546,["in the cup the spoon must stand at right angles, otherwise he won’t take it."]],[2551,["But he never gets diabetes."]],[2554,["The reason is he doesn’t think of tomorrow - he just works hard, eats his food and sleeps"]],[2561,["off, nicely."]],[2562,["He doesn’t take sleeping pills either."]],[2565,["So this diabetes comes by over-thinking and can be easily cured if you can take to Sahaja"]],[2573,["Yoga, which I’ll tell you how we’ll stop our thinking at this, I’ve already told"]],[2580,["you, at this point."]],[2583,["Then the third disease which is even more dangerous than this, is the disease which"]],[2588,["we call as blood cancer."]],[2592,["Blood cancer is caused only to people who think too much."]],[2596,["It can even be to the children if the mother is very meticulous, particular about her carpets"]],[2602,["or her house, everything you know and even a rat doesn’t enter that house."]],[2606,["But she is very careful that all her things are properly done, her sink doesn’t have"]],[2612,["even so much of, little bit of a spot left in it."]],[2617,["All the time, thinking, planning, thinking, planning."]],[2623,["This affects the child and a child also can get blood cancer."]],[2628,["Blood cancer you get it because your spleen is a speedometer- is the one which gives you"]],[2637,["the rhythm of life, rhythm of life."]],[2641,["Now when we are hectic people, all the time under shock, then this goes out of order."]],[2651,["For example in the morning we get up and see the newspaper and what you find, these Iranians"]],[2662,["have killed someone – such a shock."]],[2667,["Then an accident, then…"]],[2669,["I mean newspaper will never give good news, will they?"]],[2671,["Will they give news, how many people got realization or something is working out all, all right?"]],[2679,["No something horrible that should shock your heads, shock your limbic area – otherwise"]],[2685,["you’ll not take it seriously."]],[2689,["So, once you read that, you don’t know your system is a very delicate system, it gets"]],[2696,["a shock."]],[2697,["And then you get into your car, without taking your breakfast, or maybe in your hand is the"]],[2701,["breakfast because you are late."]],[2704,["On the way there is a jam – you are shouting, screaming - somehow or other you reach the"]],[2709,["office and there is the boss barking."]],[2715,["This is how we live, under complete tension."]],[2719,["We are supposed to be free people."]],[2722,["In the night if you sing loudly the neighbor will come and put you to the police station."]],[2730,["I mean you can’t do anything."]],[2733,["There’s no freedom."]],[2735,["You have to be bound by the watch."]],[2738,["This is the time, exact you have to reach there."]],[2742,["So all these things, pressures, and all these things work on us and we become hectic."]],[2749,["And for emergency, this spleen is the one which releases red blood corpuscles – RBCs."]],[2760,["But if you are all the time like this hectic, that poor spleen becomes mad."]],[2765,["It doesn’t know what to do."]],[2769,["It starts producing more cells, more cells and then it thinks it’s a mad person I am"]],[2776,["fixed with because I don’t know when to act, when not to act."]],[2780,["So the vulnerability is there, and suddenly with some other shock, you might get blood"]],[2785,["cancer and then the doctors will certify you are going to die after one month."]],[2790,["Finished, prepare for your burial."]],[2794,["And the whole house is crying."]],[2798,["But we have cured, I mean Sahaja Yoga has cured blood cancer of many people just by"]],[2812,["this Kundalini awakening because as soon as the Kundalini is awakened, too much movement"]],[2819,["this side and that side, this all the time going on, in the center – this is the left"]],[2825,["and the right side of the sympathetic – so just the Kundalini passes through, strings"]],[2830,["through and brings it back and nourishes it."]],[2837,["The problem is over."]],[2839,["And though they were certified to be dead, after even four years they are all right,"]],[2847,["working all right, the certificate is cancelled."]],[2855,["Even vulnerability to cancer, or to all incurable diseases, are because of these centers going"]],[2864,["out of place."]],[2870,["Now we have the center which we call here as the heart center."]],[2877,["It controls the left and right, both – so we have a left and right heart in Sahaja Yoga."]],[2884,["As you know that, this sternum bone creates the antibodies for you."]],[2897,["And these antibodies fight your diseases."]],[2902,["So when this center goes out, this is the center which sends all the messages to these"]],[2913,["antibodies."]],[2916,["Now this is the center of a mother."]],[2921,["When your motherhood is challenged, you develop breast cancer."]],[2928,["Supposing a man is a flirt and his wife is worried, she might get a breast cancer, because"]],[2936,["her motherhood is challenged and her sense of security is very disturbed."]],[2948,["As a result of that, she gets this problem."]],[2956,["Also if you are too much of a thinker, and you think too much and you’re very, what"]],[2963,["we call the right-sided, the futuristic planner, I mean people plan it for ten years."]],[2969,["They plan even their deaths, what dress they are going to wear and where they are going"]],[2975,["to be buried, up to that point."]],[2980,["All this futuristic planning creates such tremendous heat in the body because the liver,"]],[2989,["which is supposed to absorb all the heat, is neglected by this center."]],[2995,["As a result that heat travels up and you develop asthma."]],[3001,["Now we had yesterday, at least five or six people who came with asthma."]],[3008,["Asthma is absolutely curable."]],[3011,["But do you know this is the center of a husband, or of the father."]],[3016,["Now if I am telling you, you should not be shocked, because later on you’ll find it."]],[3020,["Now if you are a bad husband, you can get asthma."]],[3025,["Or if your wife is a shrew, you might get an asthma."]],[3030,["Or if you are a very bad father, you might get an asthma."]],[3036,["Or if your father is not kind to you, you might get an asthma."]],[3042,["If you have not forgiven your father, you might get asthma."]],[3047,["Now can you believe it, just forgiving your father, you can get out of your asthma permanently."]],[3054,["Sahaja Yoga has cured asthma of so many people."]],[3058,["Believe it or not, it works."]],[3062,["It looks so funny but our relationships, our parents we have chosen when we came on this"]],[3072,["Earth."]],[3073,["I know they are wrong, they are obstinate, they’re headstrong, they may be drunkards,"]],[3079,["whatever they are."]],[3080,["But even if you leave them, because so many people leave the parents, still forgive them"]],[3085,["and forget."]],[3086,["Otherwise you carry the problems with you."]],[3089,["The left heart is the place of the mother."]],[3097,["Now if your mother has been hard with you, if you have had very bad experiences, you"]],[3102,["will have problems of the left heart."]],[3107,["Center heart is very important where your sense of security should be established."]],[3111,["You’ll be surprised in the disease called AIDS, it is the center heart which is out."]],[3116,["We have tried to cure, and we cured also 3, 4 people from AIDS, but they have no will-power"]],[3124,["to continue with Sahaja Yoga, they want to die."]],[3127,["And they have made a big martyrdom out of it, you see they are martyrs, great martyrs"]],[3133,["of a great principle they have established."]],[3136,["It’s impossible to convince to them, that this is unnatural that you are doing and that"]],[3142,["you should give it up and you should live, why should you die?"]],[3145,["No, we are martyrs for such a big principle we have established."]],[3151,["To do something out of the way and new is the modern fashion."]],[3156,["Anything - will do something with the hair, with the nose, with the eyes, with the ears,"]],[3164,["with the clothes."]],[3165,["That’s all you can do."]],[3167,["To such an extent that they do not realize that whatever is new may not be good for you."]],[3176,["For example, everyday we eat our dinner."]],[3178,["Supposing we want to eat the table because it is new – is it a sensible thing?"]],[3185,["Anything that is new, is not good."]],[3189,["But anything that is old, may not be good also."]],[3192,["So you have to have that wisdom which comes to you through Sahaja Yoga."]],[3198,["There is no other way out - you have to become the spirit, and you have to see in the light"]],[3204,["of the spirit, what is right and what is wrong."]],[3207,["So then wecome to this center which is, we call as the Vishuddhi – this has sixteen"]],[3215,["petals, looks after the cervical plexus."]],[3218,["Now this is a very very important center and this is the center is for communication."]],[3223,["For example, when you talk, you communicate through your hands."]],[3228,["You shake hands, you touch somebody, and you can communicate."]],[3232,["Even if you cannot talk, with your hands you can communicate."]],[3236,["Also when we think we are very responsible, this center goes out."]],[3246,["Like some people were traveling by plane - they were from villages, they did not know what"]],[3253,["was a plane."]],[3254,["They were told to take less luggage because it should not be a weight for the plane."]],[3261,["So they got into the plane and put all of the luggage on their heads."]],[3264,["And they said that “We are trying to reduce the weight of the plane.”"]],[3271,["In the same way, we are also... actually the One - which is all-pervading power, which"]],[3278,["has created us, created this universe and has brought us to this level of human beings"]],[3283,["- is doing everything."]],[3284,["But we think we are responsible, we have to do it."]],[3289,["But once you become a Sahaja Yogi you just do it, no doubt."]],[3294,["But you don’t think that you are doing anything."]],[3297,["You just say its happening."]],[3299,["And what a beautiful feeling it is."]],[3302,["Then you don’t have blood pressures, you don’t have headaches, you don’t have tensions"]],[3309,["– no, because we are not doing it."]],[3311,["It is just done and you find it’s all done."]],[3319,["Now on this center when we come, as I’ve told you, your thinking is controlled by you,"]],[3327,["you can control."]],[3328,["If you want you can think or you don’t think."]],[3332,["But in that silence you feel your peace."]],[3335,["If there’s too much of crowds, too much of problems, suddenly you become the witness."]],[3344,["You start seeing everything."]],[3346,["Seeing the problem, what it is."]],[3350,["Unless and until you can see the problem you cannot solve it."]],[3355,["Because you are in the problem, you just get upset."]],[3358,["But if you are out of the problem, you can see it."]],[3362,["And that’s what happens to you when you become thoughtlessly aware when this center"]],[3368,["opens out."]],[3370,["Last but not the least is the center of limbic area which is very important."]],[3378,["Now I do not know it has been discovered or not, but it will be very soon discovered,"]],[3382,["that very strong things like cracks and all that have got sulfuric acid in it, and that"]],[3391,["doesn’t go anywhere in the body, just rushes into the limbic area."]],[3396,["Now this limbic area is a hollow place which has got all cells here very sensitive to joy"]],[3404,["and happiness."]],[3405,["But they become numb, so numb that ordinary music you cannot hear - somebody has to scream"]],[3413,["at you, has to shout at you, he has to jump on it, otherwise you cannot enjoy."]],[3418,["Then it has to be worse and worse and worse and worse…"]],[3424,["I don’t know now with cracks, later on they might develop something even more poisonous,"]],[3430,["because it has to excite this limbic area which is such an important thing."]],[3436,["But as soon as the Kundalini enters into that area, limbic area, she soothes it and it opens"]],[3446,["- opens like a lotus, thousand petalled lotus."]],[3453,["It opens and then the Kundalini emerges out of your fontanelle bone area and gets connected"]],[3463,["to the all-pervading power."]],[3465,["Then you start feeling the cool breeze in your hands."]],[3469,["You can feel it all over."]],[3471,["Some people in the beginning who felt cool breeze, could not believe it – so they closed"]],[3476,["doors, everything and sat down to see, still they were feeling it."]],[3481,["But it works, works in the sense that you get empowered."]],[3488,["You become peaceful, you become the witness, you become the wise and you become empowered"]],[3496,["that you can give realizations to others like this, that you can raise the Kundalini like"]],[3503,["this and you can establish that connection."]],[3506,["You can do it."]],[3509,["And this is what is your right to have it."]],[3513,["This is what will give you meaning."]],[3515,["Otherwise so far whatever we have been doing is very frustrating."]],[3522,["Now yesterday I said some questions can be asked but I haven’t seen any questions whatsoever."]],[3528,["That means you have no questions?"]],[3531,["Or there are some questions we can deal with it for about 5 minutes."]],[3566,["There’s one there, please.."]],[3574,["Question: INAUDIBLE, but someone else (a yogi near Mother?) repeats the question:"]],[3595,["[What is the process by which you one stops thinking?]"]],[3600,["It’s very simple."]],[3602,["When the Kundalini settles down there, what happens, as I told you, there is Christ – Christ"]],[3610,["is awakened and He sucks in these two institutions which you see there, the yellow and the blue."]],[3618,["These are – one is, the blue one is our conditioning and the yellow one is our ego."]],[3625,["So both these are sucked in like that."]],[3629,["These are sucked in because it is said that He died for our sins, didn’t He?"]],[3637,["He suffered for us."]],[3638,["Now also that’s why yesterday I’ve said are we going to suffer more than Him?"]],[3643,["We don’t have to suffer."]],[3645,["Only awaken Him at Agnya."]],[3648,["We are all right, this is the process, it opens out."]],[3652,["All right?"]],[3654,["That’s why I said you must forgive, because He said you have to forgive and when you forgive"]],[3661,["you can ask for forgiveness, that’s why we do both the things – one in the front"]],[3665,["and one in the back."]],[3671,["Please get up."]],[3672,["[How do you raise the Kundalini?]"]],[3678,["Automatically, I’ll tell you how."]],[3681,["Please, you see like if you have to sprout a seed you have to just put it in the Mother"]],[3685,["Earth."]],[3686,["How do you do it?"]],[3687,["The Mother Earth has got the capacity and the seed is built-in within it."]],[3693,["Now it is all built-in within you, all right."]],[3696,["And just you are here, I can raise it – anybody can raise it, those who have got the capacity"]],[3702,["– Sahaja Yogis can raise your Kundalini also."]],[3706,["[Question from the floor, : You talk about always thinking."]],[3712,["You talk about, like, if you think too much, you can actually create illness and the problems"]],[3721,["in your life."]],[3725,["How do You organize Your time and Your work and everything, but You don’t think about"]],[3731,["it?]"]],[3732,["Oh, because the Divine Power does for Me."]],[3735,["Everything is done by Divine Power."]],[3737,["Why should I think – let it think for Me."]],[3748,["You see I travel every day – I sleep at 2 o’clock in the night, get up about 5 o’clock"]],[3753,["in the morning and I travel everywhere."]],[3758,["And I’m now 67 years of age, all right, so what."]],[3763,["Divine Power is looking after Me, it’s working out everything."]],[3766,["I am just moving about nicely enjoying everything."]],[3776,["But you have to believe that you can get realization."]],[3787,["You need not believe in the Divine Power, but you just first believe that you can get"]],[3791,["realization and you get it and get in connection with it."]],[3795,["It just works."]],[3796,["It is the subtlest of subtle."]],[3799,["[Yogi, repeating the question: How can we utilize the divine power in our relationships"]],[3808,["and all the problems?]"]],[3811,["You see first of all you have to give to others."]],[3817,["Unless and until you open one door, all right that’s Divine Power there."]],[3822,["But unless and until you open other door, it won’t come in your life."]],[3826,["So you have to open the other door also."]],[3829,["There’s where we fail, we want to use Sahaja Yoga for our own purpose, for our own – my"]],[3835,["brother, my sister, my son, all sorts of my, my, my…"]],[3842,["There there’s problem – but open it out."]],[3847,["Everything works out."]],[3849,["You must learn to give."]],[3855,["This is free."]],[3859,["[Question inaudible]"]],[3866,["It is situated on top of the brain where it is above the brain, and it is covered with,"]],[3871,["the doctors say that it is 988 nerves - because I don’t want to quarrel with them."]],[3881,["But there are 1000 nerves which cover it."]],[3885,["And when it is enlightened you’ll be surprised, you’ll see a beautiful lotus opening in"]],[3892,["all colors, very very silent flames, and they are so peace-giving, looks so beautiful."]],[3908,["Because when any nerve gets enlightened, the light of that flame looks like a petal."]],[3917,["It’s very beautiful, it is."]],[3920,["But it has to open out."]],[3923,["Just now it is covered by our conditioning and our ego."]],[3926,["Like we have become like an egg we can say."]],[3930,["That’s why in Sanskrit language, a person who has known the brahma, the all-pervading"]],[3935,["power, is called as dvijaha and a bird is also called as dvijaha - means born twice."]],[3945,["First as an egg, then it becomes a bird – human being and a realized soul."]],[3982,["These are the two stages."]],[4019,["[Question inaudible]"]],[4022,["You see the thing is that now there are social conditions which are very bad, people are"]],[4029,["homeless, they are on the streets."]],[4031,["Now thinking about it you are not going to help them, are you?"]],[4036,["No."]],[4037,["Which is the best way is to empower yourself, all right?"]],[4042,["Now see for example, in the villages of India where I work, people have given them alcohol,"]],[4052,["they have given up all bad habits, they have become very dynamic, they have become very"]],[4058,["well off, they are living very well."]],[4061,["In London, if you want to work, I am sure you can get a home, no problem."]],[4070,["You see the Asians who have come here, I am an Asian though I didn’t come as an immigrant,"]],[4074,["they are becoming very rich, because they work very hard, very hard, so those who want"]],[4082,["to… in London."]],[4083,["But in India it may not be."]],[4085,["But despite that, after Sahaja Yoga they have improved so much – they have become so dynamic,"]],[4089,["they have become so hopeful of life."]],[4093,["But if you just think that life is good for nothing, let us now drink and be merry then"]],[4101,["it won’t work out."]],[4103,["These homeless and all these conditions are all such – because it is an artificial condition"]],[4108,["you know, many people have houses but they don’t want to give it for people to live."]],[4115,["Now if those people get transformation, they won’t behave like that."]],[4121,["You see the whole behavior will change when the emancipation of the society comes up."]],[4126,["But I have seen in the villages of India there’s a complete transformation."]],[4134,["The social conditions are much worse but Indians are more satisfied people, they are not so"]],[4140,["much."]],[4141,["Here even, supposing you offer a house, they will say, “No, I don’t like this house.”"]],[4147,["You offer a job, they’ll say, “I don’t want this job.”"]],[4149,["All these things are there – also too much of choices."]],[4154,["But if you decide, London is not difficult place I tell you to work hard and get a house,"]],[4160,["not difficult, they can do it."]],[4162,["But people don’t work here, don’t work."]],[4167,["There are so many old people who haven’t got anybody to help them."]],[4172,["But these people will never go and help them."]],[4176,["They can earn."]],[4177,["This is a place where anybody can earn I think, because I know people, Asians, who have come"]],[4182,["here without any money are very rich today - all have got big big cars, nice houses,"]],[4188,["this, that."]],[4189,["You can see that they are very hardworking."]],[4192,["And then divorces, everybody third day if you divorce someone what will happen to you?"]],[4197,["You’ll end up without a home."]],[4200,["No respect for the wife, the wife has no respect for the house."]],[4204,["All upside down society."]],[4206,["There’s a big quarrel going on between husband and wife – how can you have a home with"]],[4212,["this husband and wife fighting?"]],[4214,["Even TV if you open, nothing but fighting - you just don’t want to hear anyone."]],[4218,["See we had to decide on certain things – that if we have to make a home, then we have to"]],[4225,["understand our role in life."]],[4227,["For a woman and a man, I agree, they are equal, no doubt."]],[4234,["But they are like two wheels of a chariot which has some distance but they are not similar."]],[4241,["And no use fighting with each other – when you can’t live without each other, why should"]],[4246,["you fight?"]],[4247,["And the children are on the streets."]],[4249,["Every child I find 18 years of age is out of the house."]],[4254,["I mean here the little children are killed – why?"]],[4258,["In India, I cannot think of such a thing."]],[4262,["The reason, though they are very poor, the reason is they know what is love."]],[4271,["And that is what I feel that the society has to little bit take to Sahaja Yoga."]],[4276,["Now we have so many marriages in Sahaja Yoga – I mean 1% marriages fail, 1%."]],[4282,["They have beautiful children, they are living very well, they have good houses."]],[4286,["Those who were really hippies had nothing, are having nice houses and everything they"]],[4292,["have."]],[4293,["Also some of them, were “Oh, so I am now fortunately, I am without job.”"]],[4301,["And I said, “What, you are very fortunate?”"]],[4304,["“Yea, now I am without job."]],[4307,["Very happy about it.”"]],[4309,["So I told the gentleman that if you are not going to stick to one job, you are not going"]],[4315,["to come to Sahaja Yoga."]],[4318,["And that fellow today has a big car, a nice wife, children and a house."]],[4327,["So all these ideas of stupid freedom must be given up."]],[4336,["One has to come to a balance and value your life."]],[4340,["You must value it."]],[4344,["Human life is very valuable."]],[4346,["With what great difficulty God has created you and what are we doing with it?"]],[4362,["The whole society has to take a turn and think of living happily – if the husband and wife,"]],[4371,["I mean such a relationship, husband and wife cannot live together, then how do we expect"]],[4380,["this world to have United Nations?"]],[4383,["We cannot – it is falsehood."]],[4386,["In Sahaja Yoga we don’t have divorces – we have sometimes, sometimes we have, is allowed."]],[4400,["But that is mostly when they are married beforehand – fallen in love, now they are rising in"]],[4406,["love, falling in love again, again falling, rising in love again… how many times they"]],[4409,["fall in love God only knows."]],[4411,["It’s a funny stuff going on."]],[4416,["We have to face the reality."]],[4422,["So just worrying about these things, what we should do, is to first of all become wise"]],[4427,["and understand the problems."]],[4429,["We can all solve it."]],[4432,["It is very simple, it is very simple to solve the problems."]],[4437,["First of all we have to enter into the Kingdom of God."]],[4443,["And secondly, that it solves your problems."]],[4450,["Just worrying about poor people, it’s also a kind of a fashion these days."]],[4455,["Because when I went to Switzerland, I met a lady."]],[4458,["She said, “I am very guilty.”"]],[4460,["I said, “Why?”"]],[4461,["“Because of Afghanistan.”"]],[4462,["I said, “Are you Afghani?”"]],[4463,["“No, but I am guilty about Afghanistan.”"]],[4466,["“What have you got to do with Afghanistan?”"]],[4470,["“Nothing.”"]],[4471,["So it’s kind of an idea - what are we doing about it?"]],[4476,["But a Sahaja Yogi does, Sahaja Yogi finds out ways and methods of creating a convenient"]],[4491,["life – a life where you can earn, you can live… we do it – we have done, I have"]],[4496,["so many examples."]],[4503,["Because it’s a collective life also you help each other."]],[4506,["We didn’t have rich people in Sahaja Yoga many because they seldom come to Sahaja Yoga."]],[4513,["They go to false gurus because they can purchase the guru – they can’t purchase Me."]],[4518,["So mostly the rich never come here."]],[4522,["Bureaucrats also don’t come, politicians don’t come."]],[4526,["So those people who come to Me are the people who can easily solve the problem because they"]],[4532,["are so collective, they can solve the problem."]],[4540,["You’ll be surprised, I went to Turkey – My husband was not so for it – everybody said,"]],[4549,["“That’s a Muslim country, this, that.”"]],[4552,["I went to a Muslim country that was Turkey, and a woman, I just said I must go."]],[4560,["But I was surprised, they worshipped Mother, they worshipped their mothers."]],[4565,["And they were so beautiful – so many."]],[4569,["In one shot, we got 70 people – serious Sahaja Yogis."]],[4575,["But do you know when I reached there, people from America, from Australia, from all over"]],[4581,["the world arrived there in Turkey to help Me."]],[4585,["I mean I was so enamored to see My children coming, arriving there on their own - those"]],[4591,["who could afford it."]],[4594,["And the Turkish people were so beautiful, I tell you."]],[4597,["I found they are the same everywhere."]],[4602,["There’s only a skin deep difference, I tell you, otherwise we are just the same."]],[4610,["So all these problems can be easily solved – there’s nothing so serious about it."]],[4625,["There is"]],[4653,["a very great thing no doubt, but unless and until you are connected, it is like telephoning"]],[4669,["without connection."]],[4672,["There are people in India who’ll go on saying “Rama Rama Rama Rama Rama” like that."]],[4681,["And the chakra of Rama itself will be caught."]],[4684,["They’ll be saying “Shiva Shiva Shiva Shiva” and the heart chakra, where Shiva resides,"]],[4690,["it will be caught."]],[4692,["The reason is, supposing you want to meet the Queen – now if you go to Buckingham"]],[4702,["Palace and go on saying “Elizabeth, Elizabeth, Elizabeth” – you’ll be arrested!"]],[4708,["And you’ll end up in a jail!"]],[4718,["So you must have some connection, there should be some protocol."]],[4728,["Now if it is for kings and prime ministers, what about God?"]],[4734,["He’s not in your pocket."]],[4739,["But once you are realized, even once you take the name, it is sufficient."]],[4743,["What is there?"]],[4744,["He’s at your disposal all the time there."]],[4748,["But you have to have connection."]],[4750,["Now you are the citizens say of England, or some place, all right so your government is"]],[4756,["looking after you."]],[4757,["Whether you are satisfied or not is not the point."]],[4761,["But they are looking after you."]],[4763,["But if you enter into the Kingdom of God, then see the efficiency of this Kingdom."]],[4770,["You’ll be amazed if I tell you how things work out."]],[4778,["So amazing"]],[4814,["it is, so amazing."]],[4820,["See first of all they say Kundalini has to rise."]],[4826,["Then it sometimes comes back to the centers which are needing more help."]],[4833,["So it is like a rope you can say, which has many strings in it, very thin ones just like"]],[4841,["a hair, and one by one they open out."]],[4846,["So first, very few of them pierce through, open out the Sahasrara, by which you relax"]],[4855,["and the chakras open out more."]],[4858,["It goes on like that."]],[4860,["But once you are connected properly then there’s no problem."]],[4868,["But it is instantaneous, no doubt about it."]],[4872,["But for that you have to come to our centers, don’t have to pay anything, just spend some"]],[4879,["time and you have to master it, that’s all."]],[4885,["There’s a question, what purpose do we have on this planet?"]],[4894,["The purpose of our existence is to prove that God’s creation is the most successful thing."]],[4908,["That’s the purpose."]],[4913,["About Me, I will not talk - I am sorry."]],[4934,["You better get your realization and try to find out about Me, because those who have"]],[4940,["talked - you see human beings are mad people, you don’t know."]],[4943,["Christ said “I am the Son of God” – which He was no doubt."]],[4948,["And He saidthat, “I am the door” – which He was, no doubt."]],[4953,["But they crucified Him."]],[4955,["They gave poison to Mohammed Sahib."]],[4958,["They killed so many saints."]],[4960,["I know human beings very well, so please I am not going to talk to you about Myself at"]],[4965,["all."]],[4966,["You better get your self-realization - try to know Me."]],[4972,["Because I have to do some jobs, all right and for that, I want to live."]],[4980,["People are really sometimes so funny."]],[4984,["Even otherwise they behave in such a funny manner that I can’t understand."]],[4989,["As if I am going to take away their property or something."]],[4994,["I am here to give you something that is very important."]],[5001,["Sort of you can say I am here to complete the work of Christ, Mohammed and all of them."]],[5021,["Yes please…."]],[5038,["When you will give to others, you will receive the blessings."]],[5050,["That’s what it is absolutely 100%."]],[5053,["He said so many things."]],[5056,["I mean just explaining Sahaja Yoga throughout I think."]],[5064,["[Question inaudible]"]],[5074,["That"]],[5088,["should not be the question just now, all right."]],[5091,["Because to say anything about it, you know what happens with people."]],[5095,["So this can be discussed later on, when we get our self-realization."]],[5103,["Certain things at a level can be discussed and this is what happened with all of them"]],[5110,["because they had very little time to talk to you."]],[5116,["And that’s why everything has been misinterpreted, misused, because to understand the truth,"]],[5127,["to bear it also, one has to have self-realization."]],[5132,["This I have found out."]],[5134,["If you are not a self realized person you can’t bear the truth, you cannot – it’s"]],[5140,["too much for human mind to grasp and to allow it to be a part and parcel of their understanding."]],[5153,["Truth is too much for them."]],[5157,["So the first thing should be that we get our self-realization."]],[5160,["Yes, my child…"]],[5162,["[Initial question inaudible."]],[5164,["Mother: Can you get up, please?"]],[5170,["Questioner: Yes, of course"]],[5176,["Mother: Thank you."]],[5181,["Questioner: Do the colors of the chakras change all the time?[…"]],[5194,["INAUDIBLE]"]],[5195,["But the auras you see sometimes are these colors only."]],[5199,["But sometimes you are more strong with one center, so that color shows."]],[5204,["They do not change, they are just the same."]],[5211,["All right I think now it is 10 o’clock so we’ll take about 10 minutes more and let"]],[5215,["us finish with our self-realization which is going to take only 10 minutes."]],[5222,["Those who do not want to have should please leave, they should not sit here and just watch"]],[5228,["other people."]],[5229,["That’s the only kindness I request of them – that if you do not want to have self-realization,"]],[5236,["it’s better that you should leave."]],[5239,["Those people who are standing, could not get place, can come here or you can also give"]],[5245,["them places if you want to give some places."]],[5249,["No, not for Sahaja Yogis, I said for others – for others, for outsiders, Sahaja Yogis"]],[5254,["can stand up."]],[5255,["At the very outset you have to now understand that we are going to enter into the Kingdom"]],[5298,["of God and hence we have to little bit unload ourselves."]],[5309,["One of the conditions is that we should not feel guilty – one should not feel guilty"]],[5322,["at all."]],[5323,["Yesterday, same problem I said, but you were still feeling guilty."]],[5327,["Also it’s a fashion."]],[5328,["Also I think the language is such – all the time sorry, sorry, sorry, sorry…"]],[5333,["Even when we used to receive telephones we used to say “I beg your pardon.”"]],[5338,["But now it is sorry, sorry, sorry – ten times sorry."]],[5340,["What is there to be so sorry?"]],[5346,["So we have to be pleasantly placed towards ourselves."]],[5348,["We have to respect ourselves."]],[5350,["We have to be happy about ourselves."]],[5353,["This is first thing is not to feel guilty about anything - just believe that you have"]],[5361,["done nothing wrong which cannot be dissolved by this great power of forgiveness."]],[5368,["Please believe Me."]],[5372,["But if you want to stick onto a feeling like that – “No, no, I am guilty” – it’s"]],[5378,["only mental."]],[5379,["Animals don’t feel guilty about anything – a dog will bark, tiger will eat anything"]],[5387,["that it wants to."]],[5388,["It’s only human beings who feel that way – that I’ve done this wrong, I’ve done"]],[5393,["that wrong."]],[5394,["All right, so not to feel guilty that’s one point."]],[5399,["The second one is to forgive everyone, which is very difficult for many people."]],[5410,["I don’t know how many mounds of unhappiness is in the head because we cannot forgive."]],[5418,["Mounds, it’s not kilos and kilos."]],[5423,["Yesterday I found most of them had not forgiven and I had to go on putting balm on their heads"]],[5432,["to take out."]],[5433,["So you must cooperate."]],[5436,["Just forgive, just forgive everyone."]],[5441,["First of all forgive yourself and forgive everyone."]],[5445,["And be pleasantly placed towards yourself."]],[5450,["There’s no Greek tragedy going on here – no tragedy."]],[5453,["We are in a very beautiful atmosphere and we are going to go into the most beautiful"]],[5464,["area within ourselves, that is our spirit."]],[5468,["So we have to be very light about it."]],[5473,["All right, with all this understanding, I have to request you that we have to take out"]],[5482,["your shoes because this Mother Earth also helps us a lot."]],[5490,["And not to be serious – not to be serious about it."]],[5510,["It’s not frivolous, but it’s fun."]],[5524,["So you have to put your left hand towards Me, which represents your desire to get realization."]],[5543,["If all the Sahaja Yogis could also sit down it would be very nice."]],[5549,["Please be seated and don’t move about."]],[5552,["Left hand towards Me like that – be comfortable, if you want you can put it on your lap or"]],[5559,["you can put it up if you want to."]],[5561,["Then the right hand needs to be used for nourishing your centers on the left-hand side."]],[5574,["Now I’ll show you how we’ll be nourishing."]],[5578,["Before that, please remember that put your both the feet apart from each other – not"]],[5583,["too much, but slightly."]],[5586,["Now, left hand towards Me."]],[5593,["I’ll show you before and then we can close our eyes and work it out."]],[5600,["Put your right hand on your heart – in the heart resides the Spirit and Kundalini is"]],[5613,["the reflection of the Holy Ghost, of the Adi Shakti, within us, while the Spirit is the"]],[5621,["reflection of God Almighty."]],[5626,["So we put our attention to our heart first."]],[5634,["Then we take our right hand in the upper portion of our abdomen on the left-hand side and press"]],[5642,["it hard."]],[5643,["This is the center of our mastery."]],[5647,["We take down our right hand on the lower portion of our abdomen and press it hard."]],[5656,["This is the center of pure knowledge that manifests on our central nervous system."]],[5668,["We take back our hand in the upper portion of our abdomen."]],[5678,["And again we take it in the heart, in the upper portion of our heart."]],[5687,["Then we take it in the corner of our neck and our shoulder and put your head to the"]],[5696,["right."]],[5698,["This is the center we catch when we feel guilty."]],[5707,["Then we take our hand on our forehead and slowly bring down our head on it to rest."]],[5722,["Here we press it on both the sides and this is the center to forgive."]],[5733,["We take back our hand on the back side of our head and put our head resting on it - this"]],[5747,["is the center for asking forgiveness without feeling guilty."]],[5753,["We stretch our hand, with the center of our palm, we put it on our head in the soft bone"]],[5763,["area of our childhood, called as fontanelle bone area, and slowly we put down our head."]],[5772,["Here we stretch our fingers and move our scalp carefully with pressure, slowly, clockwise,"]],[5787,["seven times."]],[5793,["That’s all we have to do."]],[5811,["Now please close your eyes and don’t open them until I ask you to open because attention"]],[5820,["has to go inside."]],[5822,["Put your left hand towards Me."]],[5825,["Now first you will feel thoughtless – so don’t fight with your thoughts."]],[5830,["Automatically everything will work out."]],[5832,["Don’t fight with your thoughts, just keep watching and ultimately you will feel cool"]],[5840,["breeze coming out of your fontanelle bone area and you’ll also start feeling cool"]],[5845,["breeze all around you which is the cool breeze of the Holy Ghost, the cool breeze of the"]],[5852,["all-pervading power as described by Adi Shankaracharya, Salilam, salilam – it’s cool, and cool."]],[5862,["So now, we put our left hand this way towards Me and the right hand on the heart."]],[5875,["Here you have to ask Me a very fundamental question, three times – “Mother, am I"]],[5884,["the Spirit?”"]],[5886,["In your heart, ask the question “Mother, am I the Spirit?”"]],[5895,["If you are the spirit you are your master, because in the light of your spirit you know"]],[5907,["what is right and what is wrong – you can guide yourself."]],[5911,["So put your right hand in the upper portion of your abdomen on the left-hand side, and"]],[5918,["here please ask Me a question again three times – “Mother, am I my own master?”"]],[5929,["“Mother, am I my own master?”"]],[5938,["As I have told you that I will not cross your freedom, I respect your freedom, and only"]],[5949,["if you want I can bestow this pure knowledge on yourself, otherwise I cannot."]],[5959,["So please put your right hand in the lower portion of your abdomen and ask the question,"]],[5967,["“Mother” - or you can request “Mother please give me pure knowledge.”"]],[5982,["Say this six times because this center has got six petals."]],[5990,["“Mother, please give me pure knowledge.”"]],[6002,["Now all the prophets of the past and the saints and seers have built up for us a center of"]],[6015,["mastery."]],[6017,["But to open the center we have to have all the confidence, so please raise your hand"]],[6027,["and put it in the upper portion of your abdomen on the left-hand side and say with full confidence"]],[6039,["to nourish this center, ten times, “Mother, I am my own master.”"]],[6052,["Please say this ten times."]],[6065,["Now we have to know that we are not this body, we are not this mind, we are not these emotions,"]],[6079,["we are not this intellect."]],[6083,["We are not our conditionings or are we our ego."]],[6088,["We are pure spirit."]],[6093,["So now raise your hand to your heart and with full confidence say twelve times “Mother,"]],[6102,["I am the spirit.”"]],[6104,["Please say twelve times, “Mother, I am the spirit.”"]],[6114,["You have to know that this Divine Power is the ocean of love and compassion."]],[6128,["It is the ocean of joy and bliss but above all it is the ocean of forgiveness, so there"]],[6139,["is no mistake that you have committed which cannot be dissolved by this ocean."]],[6148,["So please forgive yourself and put your right hand in the corner of your neck and your shoulder"]],[6158,["and turn your head to your right."]],[6162,["Here you have to say with complete confidence again, “Shri Mataji, I am not guilty at"]],[6177,["all.”"]],[6178,["Or you can call Me Mother – “Mother, I am not guilty at all.”"]],[6197,["Sixteen times- please say this sixteen times."]],[6212,["Now one has to know whether you forgive someone or don’t forgive, you don’t do anything"]],[6225,["– it’s a myth."]],[6227,["But if you don’t forgive, then you play into wrong hands."]],[6232,["So put your right hand on your forehead and please bend your head, resting on the hand"]],[6244,["as much as you can and now press it on both the sides."]],[6250,["And here please, please, say it from your heart “Mother, I forgive everyone.”"]],[6259,["Please say it from your heart - please say it, otherwise again I will have to work very"]],[6268,["hard on you."]],[6269,["So please say it from your heart – “Mother, I forgive everyone.”"]],[6274,["You are not going to miss your self-realization for not forgiving, please."]],[6281,["How many lives you have been seeking the truth that this time you are not going to miss it"]],[6297,["out."]],[6298,["Now take back your hand on the back side of your head and push back"]],[6351,["your head as much as you can resting on your"]],[6477,["hand"]],[6508,["and here for your own satisfaction, without feeling guilty, without counting your mistakes,"]],[6532,["please say, “Oh Divine, if"]],[6550,["I"]],[6583,["have done any mistakes, please forgive me.”"]],[6608,["TAPE ENDS"]]]);
